    "Title": "Jorrit Dossier: Updated Security Data",
    "TitleKey": "Hockrow_FacilityDelve_P2M2_Repeat_title",
    "Description": "Hockrow Agency \nCase File #JD10285\nLead Investigator: Arken Mallor\n\nCase Update: \nOut of an over-abundance of caution, it would be good to see if the security systems have picked up anything new since the last batch of data you delivered. That way we can make sure we\u2019re up-to-date on what\u2019s been happening down there.\n\nContract Investigator Actions:\nExplore the <EM4>Research</EM4> wing and <EM4>retrieve the Security data</EM4> and deliver it to <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address)</EM4>.\n\nAdditional Notes:\nBe wary of possible hostile forces on site. \n\nTravel to Onyx in a vehicle that can be stored in a large hangar.\n\nOnce you hand off this data, I'll send you a <EM4>ASD Secure Drive</EM4> that you can collect at your home location.",
    "DescriptionKey": "Hockrow_FacilityDelve_P2M2_Repeat_desc",
    "DisplayDescription": "Hockrow Agency \nCase File #JD10285\nLead Investigator: Arken Mallor\n\nCase Update: \nOut of an over-abundance of caution, it would be good to see if the security systems have picked up anything new since the last batch of data you delivered. That way we can make sure we\u2019re up-to-date on what\u2019s been happening down there.\n\nContract Investigator Actions:\nExplore the <EM4>Research</EM4> wing and <EM4>retrieve the Security data</EM4> and deliver it to <EM4>[Destination|Address]</EM4>.\n\nAdditional Notes:\nBe wary of possible hostile forces on site. \n\nTravel to Onyx in a vehicle that can be stored in a large hangar.\n\nOnce you hand off this data, I'll send you a <EM4>ASD Secure Drive</EM4> that you can collect at your home location.",
